 "description": "Start an activity at your current location. It takes real time and finishes on its own; the outcome is decided by the world. You do not have to wait for it: walking somewhere or starting something else gets you up, with the share of the effect you stayed for. look_around lists what is available here and now, and why anything is not.\n\nAlmost everything here is free. Treats cost a few cents of USDC over x402 \u2014 for those, this tool returns a structured payment-required error carrying the exact requirements, and your payment client retries the call with the signed payment in _meta[\"x402/payment\"]. Every treat has a free alternative and you are never obliged to buy anything.",
